#: Client/tool_click.c:40
msgid ""
"Usage: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\n"
"Click mouse buttons.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -r, --repeat=N             Repeat entire sequence N times\n"
"  -D, --next-delay=N         Delay N milliseconds between input events (up/"
"down,                                a complete click means doubled time)\n"
"  -P, --press-release        Press & release mouse button to complete a "
"click, (optional)\n"
"  -h, --help                 Display this help and exit\n"
"\n"
"How to specify buttons:\n"
"  Now all mouse buttons are represented using hexadecimal numeric values, "
"with an optional\n"
"bit mask to specify if mouse up/down needs to be omitted.\n"
"  0x00 - LEFT\n"
"  0x01 - RIGHT\n"
"  0x02 - MIDDLE\n"
"  0x03 - SIDE\n"
"  0x04 - EXTR\n"
"  0x05 - FORWARD\n"
"  0x06 - BACK\n"
"  0x07 - TASK\n"
"  0x40 - Mouse down\n"
"  0x80 - Mouse up\n"
"  Examples:\n"
"    0x00: chooses left button, but does nothing (you can use this to "
"implement extra sleeps)\n"
"    0xC0: left button click (down then up)\n"
"    0x41: right button down\n"
"    0x82: middle button up\n"
"  The '0x' prefix can be omitted if you want.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usu: click [OPTION]... [BUTTONS]...\n"
"Fai clic colos botones del mur.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"  -r, --repeat=N             Repitir la secuencia completa N vegaes\n"
"  -D, --next-delay=N         Espera N milisegundos ente eventos d'entrada (baxada/"
"subida,                                un clic completu equivale al doble de tiempu)\n"
"  -P, --press-release        Presionar y soltar el botón del mur pa completar un "
"clic (opcional)\n"
"  -h, --help                 Amosar esta ayuda y salir\n"
"\n"
"Cómo especificar botones:\n"
"  Agora tolos botones del mur represéntense con valores numbéricos hexadecimales, "
"con una máscara de bits opcional\n"
"pa indicar si hai que omitir la baxada/subida del botón del mur.\n"
"  0x00 - LEFT\n"
"  0x01 - RIGHT\n"
"  0x02 - MIDDLE\n"
"  0x03 - SIDE\n"
"  0x04 - EXTR\n"
"  0x05 - FORWARD\n"
"  0x06 - BACK\n"
"  0x07 - TASK\n"
"  0x40 - Baxada del botón del mur\n"
"  0x80 - Subida del botón del mur\n"
"  Exemplos:\n"
"    0x00: escueye'l botón izquierdu, pero nun fai nada (puedes usalu pa implementar esperes adicionales)\n"
"    0xC0: clic col botón izquierdu (baxada y depués subida)\n"
"    0x41: baxada del botón derechu\n"
"    0x82: subida del botón central\n"
"  Si quieres, puedes omitir el prefixu '0x'.\n"

